# 18. Important Project Rules

## Rule 1 — Do not over-engineer

Build only what is required.

## Rule 2 — Test before claiming success

Never assume something works.

## Rule 3 — Protect personal data

Never put private financial information into the public repository.

## Rule 4 — Protect secrets

Never commit credentials or API keys.

## Rule 5 — Learn while building

Understand the purpose of every important technology.

## Rule 6 — One major step at a time

Complex setup tasks should be broken into small logical steps.

## Rule 7 — Document important decisions

Architecture and technology decisions should be recorded.

